{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:8026999633a5a08d","name":"Thrawn, Admiral","source":{"id":"source:reference-8026999633a5a08d","title":"Thrawn, Admiral","revision":19588,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:14:28Z","sha256":"ac5e54059f3a96e45c43550fdf20bbc849c940c759a921a5ecde2abc993e4ce1","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19588","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Thrawn%2C%20Admiral&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-8026999633a5a08d","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Chiss Ascendancy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Chiss_Ascendancy","referenceId":"reference:410c64a9afa98052"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["During ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Times"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Times"},", the future Grand Admiral is an anomaly within the Imperial military. First, he is an alien Imperial officer, a type of individual that has become almost unheard of since the establishment of the New Order. Second, it is obvious that the Emperor holds him in the highest regard.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Admiral Thrawn's origins are unknown to his fellow officers and crew. They know he is a brilliant tactician and wholly objective figure. They do not know that he hails from ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Chiss Ascendancy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Chiss_Ascendancy","referenceId":"reference:410c64a9afa98052"}," and was exiled from his own people. They also do not know that Thrawn is responsible for the disappearance of the ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Outbound Flight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Outbound_Flight","referenceId":"reference:18cacf0fab245b29"}]}," project many years ago, an event that first brought Thrawn to the Emperor's attention.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Times"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Times"},", the Emperor has assigned Admiral Thrawn to expand the borders of the Empire by bringing the remote and barbaric worlds of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Unknown Regions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Unknown_Regions"}," under Imperial control. With a powerful fleet, Thrawn operates independently, returning to known space only infrequently to resupply and report.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Thrawn, Admiral Statistics (CL 8)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Chiss"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Chiss","referenceId":"reference:bd57eaad77f8edcc"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Noble"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Noble","referenceId":"reference:190d375ec3483f8f"}," 3/",{"tag":"a","children":["Soldier"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Soldier","referenceId":"reference:f826baa05bef6921"}," 4/",{"tag":"a","children":["Officer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Officer","referenceId":"reference:192135a8adabe174"}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny_Points"},":"]}," 1; ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 2; ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},":"]}," 4\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6a